ps）<MATH_0032>。显然，它可以（唯一地）延拓（extends）为<MATH_0033>分次环（graded ring）映射（map）<MATH_0034>，做法是将<MATH_0035>送到（mapping）<MATH_0036>。这个映射（map）在次数（degree）为零处给出环映射（ring map）<MATH_0037>，后者给出态射（morphism）<MATH_0038>。因此，在这一特殊情形下，我们构造出了<MATH_0039>。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n下面证明引理的最后一个陈述。由引理<REF_0003>可知，其中构造的态射（morphism）是使该引理陈述中所列图表（diagram）交换（commutes）的唯一一个。该引理中的图表（diagram）的交换性（commutativity）蕴含它在限制到（restricted to）<MATH_0040>和<MATH_0041>后的交换性（commutativity）。结论由此得出。\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:5258b5bab085badfcfc7233c49fe22bc58ebe7d93a53898b0b50b95c005f561e", "unit_id": "tag:01NK:proof", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "满足两条性质的三元组。", "source_term": "triples", "target_term": "三元组"}, {"context": "比较映射时所取的底层空间。", "source_term": "topological spaces", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"context": "底层拓扑空间之间的映射。", "source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"context": "构成拓扑的基的开集。", "source_term": "opens", "target_term": "开集"}, {"context": "由这些开集构成一组基的拓扑。", "source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"context": "拓扑的开集基。", "source_term": "basis", "target_term": "基"}, {"context": "所引引理给出的拓扑空间性质。", "source_term": "sober", "target_term": "清醒"}, {"context": "具有清醒性质的空间。", "source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"context": "引用的章节名称。", "source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"context": "所引引理所在章的名称。", "source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"context": "唯一性证明中选取的齐次元素。", "source_term": "homogeneous", "target_term": "齐次的"}, {"context": "指定代数的分次。", "source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"context": "带指定分次的代数。", "source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"context": "比较的两个映射所涉及的分次环。", "source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环"}, {"context": "唯一性证明中比较的两个分次环映射。", "source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"context": "左右两侧分别以指定元素作乘法。", "source_term": "multiplication by", "target_term": "乘以"}, {"context": "左右两侧乘法所给出的同构。", "source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"context": "为比较概形态射而考察的次数。", "source_term": "degree", "target_term": "